1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:01,547
Hoo, hoo!

2
00:00:01,547 --> 00:00:02,818
Who says quack?

3
00:00:02,818 --> 00:00:04,725
Can you find the friend?

4
00:00:08,625 --> 00:00:10,170
Dotty Duckling!

5
00:00:10,170 --> 00:00:11,800
Ducks say quack.

6
00:00:12,550 --> 00:00:14,485
Quack, quack, quack!

7
00:00:14,485 --> 00:00:16,000
Waddle with me!

8
00:00:18,650 --> 00:00:20,300
Now, who says woof?

9
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:22,625
Can you point to the friend?

10
00:00:26,525 --> 00:00:27,746
Pip Puppy!

11
00:00:27,746 --> 00:00:29,625
Puppies say woof.

12
00:00:30,375 --> 00:00:31,240
Woof, woof!

13
00:00:31,240 --> 00:00:32,786
Wag your tail with me!

14
00:00:35,436 --> 00:00:37,096
And who says meow?

15
00:00:37,096 --> 00:00:38,836
Can you say it too?

16
00:00:42,736 --> 00:00:45,590
Meow! It's me, Mimi Kitten!

17
00:00:48,240 --> 00:00:51,015
How many friends did we find?

18
00:00:51,365 --> 00:00:53,015
Let's count!

19
00:00:55,015 --> 00:00:56,403
One, two, three!

20
00:00:56,403 --> 00:00:57,644
Three friends,

21
00:00:57,644 --> 00:00:59,690
and three special sounds.

22
00:01:00,040 --> 00:01:01,765
Hoo, hoo!

23
00:01:04,415 --> 00:01:06,221
Share with a friend and

24
00:01:06,221 --> 00:01:08,515
subscribe to Honey Bunny Kidz!

25
00:01:09,115 --> 00:01:10,752
Watch the full story

26
00:01:10,752 --> 00:01:12,390
on Honey Bunny Kidz!
